    "Declan, you told us your biggest customers didn't want any extra hassle. So we built this around one rule. Your customers change nothing.",
    "A PO emailed in, exactly the way HPC or Grafton send it today, lands here as a draft order. Nobody logged in. Nobody uploaded anything.",
    "Every line is matched to your stock codes, and it remembers each customer as you go.",
    "The PO comes straight off their document. Send the same one twice and you're warned. And it carries straight through to Sage.",
    "For customers who want it, reordering takes two taps from their confirmation email. No password. And if they never use it, email still works.",
    "Every branch sits under one account, with its own buyers and delivery address. Dublin and Cork each see their own agreed price. Rebates never show.",
    "A WhatsApp order at nine at night? Your team pastes it in, and it's read straight into a draft basket, PO checked and all.",
    "No public prices and no self sign-up. Every account is approved by you, so you're never seen selling over the heads of your merchants.",
    "Your catalogue's already in. We just need your standard Sage exports. And your website stays exactly where it is."
  ],
